  970                   ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  971                   ; Select disk (used by BDOS)
  972                   ; drive-code in C (0..n-1)
  973                   ; seldsk sets also the parameters for blocking/deblocking and for the phys.
  974                   ; drive parameters. The phys. drive parameters can be request by the new
  975                   ; BIOS function GETPHY.
  976                   
  977 E482  21 0000     SELDSK:	LD HL,0		; und pruefen ob gueltig
  978 E485  79          	LD A,C		; wenn groesser als ndisks
  979 E486  FE 08       	CP NDISKS	; dann nicht ok
